<title>USA: MONTGOMERY SECURITIES SETTLES NASDAQ LAWSUIT.</title>
<headline>MONTGOMERY SECURITIES SETTLES NASDAQ LAWSUIT.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Montgomery Securities said it settled the NASDAQ market-makers antitrust litigation for $20 million.</p>
<p>Montgomery said it firmly believes it is not liable for the claims made in the litigation and the firm was not sued by the Department of Justice in this matter.</p>
<p>It said it settled the case to avoid costly and distracting litigation and that the settlement will have no impact on the planned merger with NationsBank.</p>
<p>The antitrust litigation was brought against 30 defendants of which six have now settled.</p>
</text>
